{"id":"959b7a3f4e264cd5","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kurtz-null-test-char.md","title":"Kurtz 随机性的有限闭开检验刻画","display":"thm-kurtz-null-test-char — Kurtz 随机性的有限闭开检验刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kurtz-null-test-char","aliases":["43-thm-kurtz-null-test-char"],"display":"thm-kurtz-null-test-char — Kurtz 随机性的有限闭开检验刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","[[43-df-kurtz-null-test]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.5.1 Theorem 10.5.3，印刷233，PDF253","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kurtz-null-test-char"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kurtz-null-test-char</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kurtz-null-test-char — Kurtz 随机性的有限闭开检验刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1e7f22030c79f92b\" href=\"?note=1e7f22030c79f92b\" title=\"43-df-kurtz-null-test\">43-df-kurtz-null-test</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.5.1 Theorem 10.5.3，印刷233，PDF253"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e7f22030c79f92b\" href=\"?note=1e7f22030c79f92b\" title=\"43-df-kurtz-null-test\">43-df-kurtz-null-test</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}\\)</span> 是序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e7f22030c79f92b\" href=\"?note=1e7f22030c79f92b\" title=\"43-df-kurtz-null-test\">43-df-kurtz-null-test</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_nU_n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_nU_n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从有效开全测集的有限阶段枚举中取测度足够大的部分，再取补。源书证明的V_n需理解为有限开近似的补集，且逼近阈值为1−2^{-n}；草稿抽取文本遗漏横线与1−。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.5.1 Theorem 10.5.3，印刷233，PDF253。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtz-null-test","status":"resolved","id":"1e7f22030c79f92b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kurtz-null-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-kurtz-null-test]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtz-null-test","status":"resolved","id":"1e7f22030c79f92b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-kurtz-null-test]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtz-null-test","status":"resolved","id":"1e7f22030c79f92b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}$ 是序列 $U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-kurtz-null-test]]。\n$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}$ 是序列 $U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-kurtz-null-test]]。\n$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_nU_n\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1429,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-209","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kurtz-null-test-char]] — Kurtz 随机性的有限闭开检验刻画"}],"outgoing":["1b1a52dd1295c33c","1e7f22030c79f92b"]}